WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
A clock reaches twelve minutes. The promise sounds simple.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
A structured audio library may help you make room for a routine.
That is a format, not a guaranteed result.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:26.000
The seller describes twelve levels and forty-eight MP3 recordings.
They also advertise a return policy.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:35.000
But claims about accelerated meditation and health need relevant
independent proof. Read the evidence before buying.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Start with a free twelve-minute routine.
Compare the actual offer only when the facts and terms are clear.
